      <article class="prose-shopify mt-14 max-w-4xl">
        <p>These are proposed test scenarios and illustrative calculations, not observed supplier results. Contribution equals AOV × (gross margin rate − discount rate), assuming fixed product cost; discount loss equals AOV × discount rate, before messaging, shipping, taxes, returns and other variable costs. Timings below are separate test variants, not a combined send schedule. Channel suggestions require current integration and sending-capability checks for each product. Before each send, the queue owner must recheck current purchase, stock and suppression state, purpose-specific permission and quiet hours, and deduplicate replayed events.</p>
        <p>Brevo vs Recart: scenario 1 — size matrix with two variants OOS. At $345 AOV and 58% margin, full-price recovery contributes $200.1 vs $155.25 after a 13% code (Δ $44.85). Ladder touch 1 favors push nudge; watch for attribution credit on would-have-returned orders. Email 1 ~113m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~7h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Brevo vs Recart: scenario 2 — gift message field abandoned mid-flow. At $345 AOV and 58% margin, full-price recovery contributes $200.1 vs $155.25 after a 13% code (Δ $44.85). Ladder touch 2 favors no-discount assist; watch for recovery for fully OOS cart. Email 1 ~113m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~7h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Brevo vs Recart: scenario 3 — high-AOV cart with financing widget opened. At $345 AOV and 58% margin, full-price recovery contributes $200.1 vs $155.25 after a 13% code (Δ $44.85). Ladder touch 3 favors email proof; watch for duplicate SMS and email within 20 minutes. Email 1 ~113m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~7h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Brevo vs Recart: scenario 4 — bundle discount not applied in cart. At $345 AOV and 58% margin, full-price recovery contributes $200.1 vs $155.25 after a 13% code (Δ $44.85). Ladder touch 4 favors SMS urgency; watch for welcome discount stacking with cart code. Email 1 ~113m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~7h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>Brevo vs Recart: scenario 5 — BNPL selected then dropped at review. At $345 AOV and 58% margin, full-price recovery contributes $200.1 vs $155.25 after a 13% code (Δ $44.85). Ladder touch 1 favors push nudge; watch for discount on email one before trust proof. Email 1 ~113m, email 2 ~18h, SMS branch ~7h for opted-in only.</p>
